{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SOLARFLARE is a byte-sized roguelike auto-battler set in a sci-fi dystopia. Fight to unlock 30 different Upgrades, experiment to find broken builds, and obliterate the megacorp's bots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/9284ca9027b4fa15f8e07b9e8ef5e0b3.avif?t=1774125901\" width=780 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat your varied opponents by building a robot army, sniping them from afar, rushing them down and impaling them on your spikes, or using EMP to disrupt their weapons (and also <i>your</i> weapon). Each Upgrade is weak in isolation, but combines explosively with other Upgrades you unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/b288e0e52c3b271fcd885679eeb192b2.poster.avif?t=1774125901\" width=780 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/b288e0e52c3b271fcd885679eeb192b2.webm?t=1774125901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/b288e0e52c3b271fcd885679eeb192b2.mp4?t=1774125901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose wisely, scale wildly, and destroy your enemies in a riot of violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/2bea09c7377ef608bf01d98717106a0c.poster.avif?t=1774125901\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/2bea09c7377ef608bf01d98717106a0c.webm?t=1774125901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/2bea09c7377ef608bf01d98717106a0c.mp4?t=1774125901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/aa1d22159a2964e7502d40c144672c65.avif?t=1774125901\" width=780 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a new agent of SOLARFLARE, we solemnly promise that you will die. You will be drained by Needlers, excavated by Drillbots, and/or sniped from afar (yes, sorry, they have sniper rifles, too).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/c753043530d4c19b508f5c0c99061fb1.poster.avif?t=1774125901\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/c753043530d4c19b508f5c0c99061fb1.webm?t=1774125901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/c753043530d4c19b508f5c0c99061fb1.mp4?t=1774125901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember to review the combat log to figure out why you died! Alternatively, give up in a huff and try a different build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/60376f8567ddb6f3964b9dbe18bf342c.avif?t=1774125901\" width=780 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this cold and indifferent galaxy, SOLARFLARE tries to be slightly warmer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/ceb7fbd860b6a515f30be44fd59b09d2.poster.avif?t=1774125901\" aria-label=\"Image rotating through four characters: Fox, Bubblegum, Ed, and &amp;lt;U&amp;gt;\" width=376 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/ceb7fbd860b6a515f30be44fd59b09d2.webm?t=1774125901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We need the four of you to raid another megacorp, steal their equipment, sabotage their projects, and recruit their indentured employees. Don't worry, they started it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/f64681fb33469e2fba7cca56d85b918f.avif?t=1774125901\" width=780 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a tiny game, at a tiny price!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I predict you'll have fun figuring out how the systems work, how not to die, and then how to win. You'll turn up the game speed and exult in the slaughter of your enemies for a little while. After you win the first time, it'll be pretty easy to win again. So I suggest turning up the difficulty to see just how good your build is (probably not to 10, that's a <i>very</i> high number). Look for a few different builds that utilize different Upgrades. All told, you should get a few hours of juicy build-crafting goodness out of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a lot of people <i>really</i> like what they see here, I might add more. To make this more probable, deposit all of your hopes and dreams in <strong>Community Hub &gt; Discussions</strong>, or Screenshots, or Reviews.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3941030?t=1774125901","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3941030?t=1774125901","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/71c0c6fd94f0f1ec622c94fb107d845b1f78f2d2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774125901","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/71c0c6fd94f0f1ec622c94fb107d845b1f78f2d2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774125901","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SOLARFLARE is a byte-sized roguelike auto-battler set in a sci-fi dystopia. Fight to unlock 30 different Upgrades, experiment to find broken builds, and obliterate the megacorp's bots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/9284ca9027b4fa15f8e07b9e8ef5e0b3.avif?t=1774125901\" width=780 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat your varied opponents by building a robot army, sniping them from afar, rushing them down and impaling them on your spikes, or using EMP to disrupt their weapons (and also <i>your</i> weapon). Each Upgrade is weak in isolation, but combines explosively with other Upgrades you unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/extras/b288e0e52c3b271fcd885679eeb192b2.poster.avif?t=1774125901\" width=780 height=348 ><source src=\