30/extras/f64681fb33469e2fba7cca56d85b918f.avif?t=1774125901\" width=780 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a tiny game, at a tiny price!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I predict you'll have fun figuring out how the systems work, how not to die, and then how to win. You'll turn up the game speed and exult in the slaughter of your enemies for a little while. After you win the first time, it'll be pretty easy to win again. So I suggest turning up the difficulty to see just how good your build is (probably not to 10, that's a <i>very</i> high number). Look for a few different builds that utilize different Upgrades. All told, you should get a few hours of juicy build-crafting goodness out of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a lot of people <i>really</i> like what they see here, I might add more. To make this more probable, deposit all of your hopes and dreams in <strong>Community Hub &gt; Discussions</strong>, or Screenshots, or Reviews.</p>","developers":["Swarmforge"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941030/d36f4ae6e9bd050c115e0f54aceeab031b3fcf33/header.jpg?t=1774125901","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3941030/1615395427/c365826fe847e6890cf8e814426add0a4a156272/1755303941/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756755294","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3941030/1615395427/c365826fe847e6890cf8e814426add0a4a156272/1755303941/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756755294","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trai